the pen. When she turned to face him again, he was still sitting obediently in his place.

38
00:04:42.492 --> 00:04:51.803
"Yes!" Jackie said. Howler quivered but didn't move. His eyes carefully watched her face. "Come!" Howler ran

39
00:04:51.804 --> 00:05:06.866
to her, stopping at her side. Jackie gave the dog a treat and then stroked his velvety

40
00:05:06.867 --> 00:05:14.216
ears. The beagle was sweet, and he seemed smart too. Jackie's mind was made up. "We

41
00:05:14.217 --> 00:05:20.469
can do this! Howler, you and I are going to be a team!" "Yip!" While Howler munched

