43
00:05:28.523 --> 00:05:36.429
to study breed standard now." Hudson sent her a huge thumbs-up emoji. Jackie sent back a face

44
00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:40.179
with sweat dripping down its cheeks. She hoped she wasn't making a big mistake! *** Later,

45
00:05:40.180 --> 00:05:49.028
when Jackie left the kennels, she found Poke lying outside by the gate. His nose rested on

46
00:05:49.029 --> 00:05:52.501
his paws as he looked up at her. She had never seen such a sad look in

47
00:05:52.502 --> 00:05:59.835
his eyes. "Ready for a walk?" she asked. Poke bounced to his feet, wagging his tail. Jackie

48
00:05:59.836 --> 00:06:09.583
laughed. "At least you don't hold a grudge." Jackie jogged as Poke trotted beside her. They

49
00:06:09.584 --> 00:06:17.409
circled the yard and then headed down the path to the small pond at the back of

50
00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:25.990
Grandma's farm. Poke's ears pricked forward as he realized where they were going. The pond was one

51
00:06:25.991 --> 00:06:29.720
of his favorite places on the farm. Jackie stopped to catch her breath. Poke stood waiting

52
00:06:29.721 --> 00:06:36.565
near the water. When she picked up a stick, his front feet pranced. No one had trained

53
