58
00:07:22.789 --> 00:07:30.026
As they headed back to the kennels, Jackie looked at Poke. "You smell like fish, buddy! How

59
00:07:30.027 --> 00:07:40.751
about a bath?" "Whoof!" Poke closed his eyes as Jackie rinsed him off. From the wooden

60
